{"kind": "mod", "id": 1568, "name": "Penalties Removed", "slug": "penalties-removed", "teaser": "Removes movement, turn, ergo, and hearing penalties from equipment (Armor, Plates, Rigs, Backpacks, Facemasks, Helmets). \r\n\r\nAlso removes negative ergo effects from weapon attachments.", "owner_name": "Mattdokn", "downloads": 29550, "favourites": 29, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.mattdokn.penaltiesremoved", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Equipment", "category_id": 15, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T08:01:06.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-07-15T21:14:43.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-07-15T21:14:43.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.3.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Basics</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Removes various penalties from armor and equipment. Also zeros out negative ergo stats on negative ergonomic weapon attachments.</p>\n<h3>Effected Penalties</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Ergonomics (Armor penalty removed, weapon mods that have negative have been set to 0 ergo)</li>\n<li>Turn speed</li>\n<li>Movement speed</li>\n<li>Deafness on helmets</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Simply extract mattdokn-penaltiesremoved.zip into your game folder</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/7658-vkrw58b-1-gif/\" alt=\"7658-vkrw58b-1-gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Config</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>The config has comments in it to explain.</p>\n<p>You can toggle equipment effects, as well as weapon mods being effected.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>If you see anything that stands out to you, please let me know in the comments!</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support My Work</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Never feel obligated to donate for support.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn</a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4606, "published_at": "2024-12-23T17:00:03.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1568/penalties-removed/1.1.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 6256, "published_at": "2025-05-31T03:18:57.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1568/penalties-removed/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 11278, "downloads": 268, "published_at": "2026-02-08T01:32:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1568/penalties-removed/1.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 11269, "downloads": 8726, "published_at": "2026-02-09T01:51:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1568/penalties-removed/1.3.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "co